  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈『W.I.N.G.』のステージが終わったばかりなんだ\r\n無理しないで、もう練習を終えたらどうだ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "014",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
